{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/20267GyXANnntZ1795574452.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>TVB台慶劇《玫瑰戰爭》正於翡翠台熱播，劇中由陳自瑤飾演的關子盈與馬國明飾演的李德龍這對「虐心CP」，連日來牽動不少觀眾的情緒。隨著劇情發展，二人最終陰陽相隔，李德龍在得悉關子盈生前的悲慘遭遇後不禁心痛爆喊，令一眾劇迷看得相當心酸。</p><p></p><p>為撫慰觀眾受傷的心靈，陳自瑤於24日在社交平台上載多張劇中與馬國明甜蜜拍拖的合照，更代入角色「子盈」的口吻隔空安慰對方：「不要為我太傷心難過，有你在我身邊的日子，已經是最幸福的…..」。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"d5eb3cf0-1584-4ad3-8898-a16ab256d757.jpeg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026Q4MwAZTQXo1795574451.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>從公開的劇照可見，頭戴漁夫帽的陳自瑤對著鏡頭鬼馬嘟嘴，身旁穿著淺灰色休閒套裝的馬國明則展露溫暖笑容，二人在絕美海景的襯托下顯得格外養眼。而在另一張合照中，兩人更「頭貼頭」深情對望，一同開懷大笑，畫面極度甜蜜。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"5dbe202c-621a-422a-9581-4b405c3530d7.jpeg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026PLgOC2dAWV1795574451.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"ef2992e1-2538-428c-b6e8-638ddbb29c8a.jpeg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026vMo5zSLITa1795574450.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>這輯甜蜜劇照曝光後隨即引起網民熱議，大批網民紛紛湧入留言區大讚二人極具CP感，留言表示「咁襯嘅」、「可愛」；就連飾演「林安安」的鄺潔楹亦忍不住留言驚呼：「德龍子盈咁sweet㗎咩」！</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T03:23:54.151047+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":407,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T02:34:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T07:37:17.066365+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T03:17:17.967592+00:00","content_hash":"697cbb3261da9d8ac7cf83b9ba76b908479ee0e8ba91c7f0e6c4f98dfe7bbbf3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-25T03:23:54.151047+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}